WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.960
These thoughts and feelings can change how we act.

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:05.280
We might start keeping to ourselves.

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:07.360
We might start getting into fights.

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.880
We might even start breaking rules.

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:13.640
Some people might do all of these things and more.

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:15.800
It can also affect our bodies.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.400
We might get stomach aches, headaches,

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.280
or have trouble sleeping.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:22.280
This means that good and bad things

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:25.440
don't just change how you think, feel, and act,

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:28.000
but also how your body feels.

00:00:28.399 --> 00:00:31.199
One reason we like talking to students about triggers

00:00:31.199 --> 00:00:33.560
is to help you understand yourself better.

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:35.719
That is, you can start figuring out

00:00:35.719 --> 00:00:38.399
why certain things make you feel the way you do.

